{"id":"db7c5834b8f0957b","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-collapse.md","title":"Collapse Forcing","display":"df-collapse — Collapse Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-collapse","aliases":["58-df-collapse"],"display":"df-collapse — Collapse Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-collapse — Collapse Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\in V\\)</span> (Levy collapse carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coll}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Coll}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (本文件定义的兼容别名)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}collapse} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{Coll}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}collapse} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{Coll}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a> 中规范 Levy collapse 载体的兼容别名，不再另造含未绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 的条件集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\)</span> 压缩区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\([\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 内的基数；它不会“把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-levy.md","status":"resolved","id":"a400266e1814b901","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-levy.md","status":"resolved","id":"a400266e1814b901","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ and $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-levy.md","status":"resolved","id":"a400266e1814b901","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,<\\lambda)\\in V$ (Levy collapse carrier, see [[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-levy.md","status":"resolved","id":"a400266e1814b901","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是 [[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]] 中规范 Levy collapse 载体的兼容别名，不再另造含未绑定 $\\eta$ 的条件集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,<\\lambda)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coll}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}collapse} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa<\\lambda\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{Coll}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,<\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,<\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\kappa,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1138,"backlinks":[{"id":"20744306a701f3a7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a03035be819b8e1f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-336","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-collap